      <description>&lt;p&gt;Any &lt;a href="https://mastodon.com.pl/tags/furry" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;furry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://mastodon.com.pl/tags/feminist" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;feminist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, or &lt;a href="https://mastodon.com.pl/tags/women" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;women&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; dominated company looking for a software engineer in CET timezone?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I use tests as a medium for inductive reasoning, I get my hands dirty with infrastructure work, I master tools as needed, I cherish mine and others’ right to forget, I praise people for their achievements even when their mistakes make me scream at the walls in the privacy of my home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I can start sprinting with Elixir, Ruby, and JS/Typescript, running with Go, walking with Python and PHP, and crawling with anything that can be learned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mastodon.com.pl/tags/getfedihired" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;getfedihired&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.com.pl/tags/FediHire" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FediHire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
