      <description>&lt;p&gt;Canadian job &amp;amp; contract leads (any duration), I'm not affiliated with any of these companies:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;McMaster University is hiring a Jr. WordPress Dev &amp;amp; Client Sup at their central campus. This is a 24-month full-time (35 hours per week) position, paying $26.99 - $38.03 hourly. Closing date to apply is November 19th 2026. Apply at &lt;a href="https://careers.mcmaster.ca/psp/prcsprd/EMPLOYEE/HRMS/c/HRS_HRAM.HRS_APP_SCHJOB.GBL?Page=HRS_APP_JBPST&amp;amp;Action=U&amp;amp;FOCUS=Applicant&amp;amp;SiteId=1001&amp;amp;JobOpeningId=78561&amp;amp;PostingSeq=1" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;careers.mcmaster.ca/psp/prcspr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;d/EMPLOYEE/HRMS/c/HRS_HRAM.HRS_APP_SCHJOB.GBL?Page=HRS_APP_JBPST&amp;amp;Action=U&amp;amp;FOCUS=Applicant&amp;amp;SiteId=1001&amp;amp;JobOpeningId=78561&amp;amp;PostingSeq=1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AMD is hiring for 83 different roles in Markham, Ontario. They include a salary range in each job description. See all the roles they are hiring for at &lt;a href="https://careers.amd.com/careers-home/jobs?city=MARKHAM&amp;amp;page=1" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;careers.amd.com/careers-home/j&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;obs?city=MARKHAM&amp;amp;page=1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Urbacon is hiring an IT Support Specialist, fully in-person (5 days a week) at their office (750 Lakeshore Blvd East in Toronto). Salary range is $62,000 - $72,000. Details at &lt;a href="https://urbacon.bamboohr.com/careers/118" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;urbacon.bamboohr.com/careers/1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open Finance Consortium (the collective behind Open Collective) is hiring an Executive Director. Details: "location is remote, within 5 hours of GMT. Contract: Fixed term, initially 60–80% of full-time equivalent (3-4 days a week). Compensation: US$120,000-$150,000 per year depending on experience and time commitment. We’re open to discussing the balance between hours and pay". Details to apply are at &lt;a href="https://techjobsforgood.com/jobs/37560/" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=""&gt;techjobsforgood.com/jobs/37560/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. h/t to &lt;span class="h-card" translate="no"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/@Thayer" class="u-url mention" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;@&lt;span&gt;Thayer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/@Thayer/117569029412359447" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;mastodon.social/@Thayer/117569&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;029412359447&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://aus.social/tags/WPJobs" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WPJobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://aus.social/tags/WPCareers" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WPCareers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://aus.social/tags/WordPressJobs" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WordPressJobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://aus.social/tags/CanadaJobs" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CanadaJobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://aus.social/tags/CanadianJobs" class="mention hashtag" re